                <pb facs="0410" n="317" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg317"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3231/1074: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Frost</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-11-14T16:00:00-03:00">November 14, 1935—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 14—2:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>292. My 291, November 14, 11 a.m.<anchor n="21" xml:id="d339-f1"/> Treaty just
                    unanimously approved by the Senate. Will probably be promulgated by the
                    President of the Chamber of Deputies on Saturday, tomorrow being Brazil’s
                    national holiday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frost</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
